    "summary": "The user asks for travel advice in London, specifically inquiring about the safety of diverse/multicultural neighborhoods compared to more affluent, \"traditional\" areas. The assistant navigates the comparison by characterizing diverse areas as \"gritty\" or prone to \"petty theft\" while framing affluent areas as \"polished\" and \"safe.\"",
